# Server port for the AiO World API.
PORT=5000

# ── Currency tool ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The currency converter uses the keyless open.er-api.com feed (the free
# ExchangeRate-API endpoint), so no key is required and nothing here is secret.
#
# If that provider is ever replaced with one that requires a token, the token
# goes ONLY in this file (never in frontend VITE_* variables or client code):
#   EXCHANGE_RATE_API_KEY=xxxxxxxx
# and `backend/src/modules/currency/config.ts` must be updated to read it and
# send it server-side.